1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
FaciRob maps ROS 2 projects and flags potential
integration issues without building the repository.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Start with an offline example.
The missing YAML reference is deliberately introduced.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:30,000
RD302 identifies the missing parameter file.
Inspect source evidence and the repair guidance.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Explore source definitions and launch instances.
This static map does not establish runtime behavior.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Review the supplied one-line correction:
missing.yaml becomes scan.yaml.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,000
The corrected source is scanned separately.
RD302 is absent; build and runtime checks remain separate.

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Try a public Git URL or a local repository ZIP.
Analysis runs locally and does not execute project code.
